OL,3,A'A way to escape': Fan excitement as
OL,4,Anew ACOTAR book hits shelves
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday evening, a midnight release
OL,7,Fevent was held in The Secret Bookshelf,
OL,8,Fan independent bookshop just off the
OL,9,Ftown's main street.
